      <notesStmt>
        <annot>Transcription: Corpus Monodicum (Akademie der Wissenschaften und der Literatur Mainz / Universität Würzburg), document Pa 903-0194-3GS, https://stagedata.corpus-monodicum.de/mei/03784532-09f4-4db2-96ec-6b3c8d8801a0/Pa%20903-0194-3GS.xml, which transcribes the Graduale Synopticum (Universität Regensburg; database by Xaver Kainzbauer), no. 0194; © Corpus Monodicum. Pitches read an octave lower than there. Neume division, shapes and facsimile zones: a close reading of the BnF scan of f. 14v (October 2026), written as Aquitanian neumes on one editorial line (F).</annot>
      </notesStmt>
